  "_note": "Madurai-district CGWB ground water monitoring stations, extracted from CGWB's annual Ground Water Year Books for Tamil Nadu & Puducherry. Each well's `readings[]` array is appendable as more years' Year Books are processed - schema accommodates a multi-year time series indexed by lat/lng (well identity is geometric, since Sl No varies year to year and station names sometimes drift). Replaces the IDW-interpolated 100-ward depth view as the authoritative groundwater rendering for Madurai. Each well taps the phreatic (unconfined) aquifer with quarterly readings in metres below ground level (m bgl). Piezometers / tube wells reported in the 2023-24 Year Book annexure tap deeper semi-confined to confined aquifers and are tracked separately when we surface that view; this file is dug-well only.",
