      "source_url_status": "BROKEN - verified 2026-07-26. The URL previously recorded here (cgwbpnm/public/uploads/documents/16881058231005451482file.pdf) resolves 200 but is the GROUNDWATER YEAR BOOK OF TAMIL NADU AND U.T. OF PUDUCHERRY (2017-2018), 146 pages - NOT the 2024-25 edition. The wells below carry 2023, 2024 and 2025 readings, so they cannot have come from it; the link was mis-pasted. The 2024-25 PDF has no working public URL we have found: the cgwbpnm search UI 404s and the direct-PDF ids are opaque and not guessable. OPEN TRACE.",
